<h2>{{title}}</h2>
<p>Played with the mouse</p>
<div class="row"><span class="label">RMB</span><span>exit screen, close popup</span></div>
<div class="row"><span class="label">Space</span><span>advance time</span></div>
<div class="row"><span class="label">{{menu_key}}</span><span>recomp menu</span></div>
<div class="row"><span class="label">F5 / F9</span><span>quick save / quick load</span></div>
